 <strong>ice</strong> mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  • Intense enemy patterns and bullet-heavy encounters  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenging boss fights  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Score-based progression system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Secret levels and hidden bosses  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Designed for controller playX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699500/extras/cfa5949a24db2a27c9515413ca72d483.poster.avif?t=1788284793\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699500/extras/cfa5949a24db2a27c9515413ca72d483.webm?t=1788284793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699500/extras/cfa5949a24db2a27c9515413ca72d483.mp4?t=1788284793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless enemies, improve your skills, and push your limits in a classic arcade experience with modern mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699500/extras/da9bebce29b881281e78e168214106a8.avif?t=1788284793\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek revenge and reclaim your power in a hostile world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced arcade gallery shooter inspired by classics like WildGuns and Cabal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through relentless enemy waves, survive dense bullet patterns, and take down powerful bosses in fast and reactive co